{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553710/extras/P_K_1.png?t=1744164911\" /><br>Ponkots is a casual coop 2D game currently in development for 3 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players control the small toys and avoid the &quot;Houdan&quot; and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Escape from the Evil Tin Kings</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bad toy Kings are trying to capture the small toys. The interference attacks from them are really troublesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the small toys sometimes become Ponkots (unresponsive). When that happens, everyone need help each oher to save Ponkots small toys don't get hit by the &quot;Houdan&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to escape together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553710?t=1744164911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553710?t=1744164911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553710/eee0fc7606cc8a945ba3ba4d7a516783703e3ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744164911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553710/eee0fc7606cc8a945ba3ba4d7a516783703e3ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744164911","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","d